{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"防止 Agent 乱调用工具的策略\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">如何防止 Agent 乱调用工具（工具调用幻觉）？有哪些工程上的防护策略？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工具调用幻觉（Tool Calling Hallucination）是指 LLM 在不该调用工具时调用、选择不存在的工具、编造参数、漏填必填字段等问题。需要通过\"定义层 + 校验层 + 执行层\"的多层防线来防控。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"工具调用幻觉的三种类型\" dir=\"auto\">工具调用幻觉的三种类型</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Type 1: 调错工具</strong></td>\n<td>选择了不相关或错误的工具</td>\n<td>工具描述模糊、职责重叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Type 2: 参数错误</strong></td>\n<td>编造参数、类型错误、漏填必填项</td>\n<td>Schema 约束不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Type 3: 无意义调用</strong></td>\n<td>闲聊场景也调工具、反复调同一工具</td>\n<td>缺少调用必要性判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"五层防护体系\" dir=\"auto\">五层防护体系</h3>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第一层：工具定义层（源头控制）\" dir=\"auto\">第一层：工具定义层（源头控制）</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 精确的工具描述</span>\ntool_schema <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"query_order\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"查询订单信息。仅当用户提供了有效订单号时调用。\"</span>\n              <span class=\"token string\">\"不适用于：查询物流状态（用query_logistics）、查询退款（用query_refund）。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"object\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"properties\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"order_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"pattern\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"^ORD[0-9]{10}$\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 正则约束格式</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"订单号，格式 ORD+10位数字，如 ORD2024010001\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"required\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"order_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 工具职责互斥检查</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">validate_tool_uniqueness</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检查工具描述是否存在重叠\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> t1 <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">enumerate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t2 <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>i<span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            similarity <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> calculate_description_similarity<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                t1<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> t2<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> similarity <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.7</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> ValueError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"工具 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>t1<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'name'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 和 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>t2<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'name'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 描述重叠度 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>similarity<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token format-spec\">.2f</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第二层：调用前门禁层\" dir=\"auto\">第二层：调用前门禁层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ToolCallGatekeeper</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工具调用前的门禁检查\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> registered_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>registered_tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> registered_tools\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_history <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">check</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">tuple</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"返回 (是否允许, 拒绝原因)\"\"\"</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 工具名白名单校验</span>\n        tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>registered_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"工具 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 未注册\"</span></span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 重复调用检测</span>\n        recent_calls <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>c <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> c <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> \n                       <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> c<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> c<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"args\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>recent_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"检测到重复调用，已拦截\"</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 调用频率限制</span>\n        recent_same_tool <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>c <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> c <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> \n                           <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> c<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>recent_same_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"工具 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 调用过于频繁\"</span></span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 高风险工具人工确认</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> HIGH_RISK_TOOLS<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"高风险操作需要人工确认\"</span>\n        \n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span>\n\nHIGH_RISK_TOOLS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"delete_data\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"transfer_money\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"send_email\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"modify_permissions\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第三层：参数校验层\" dir=\"auto\">第三层：参数校验层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> jsonschema\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> jsonschema <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> validate\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ParameterValidator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"参数严格校验\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_schemas<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"tool_schemas: {tool_name: json_schema}\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>schemas <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_schemas\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">validate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">tuple</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        schema <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>schemas<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. JSON Schema 校验</span>\n            validate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>instance<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> schema<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>schema<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 业务规则校验</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_business_validation<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span>\n            \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> jsonschema<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>exceptions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ValidationError <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"参数校验失败: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> ValueError <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"业务规则校验失败: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_business_validation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"业务规则校验\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"query_order\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            order_id <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"order_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> order_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>startswith<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"ORD\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> ValueError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"订单号必须以 ORD 开头\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"date_range_query\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            start <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"start_date\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            end <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"end_date\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> start <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> end <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> start <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> end<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> ValueError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"开始日期不能晚于结束日期\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 限制查询范围，防止全表扫描</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> start <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> end <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>end <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> start<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>days <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">90</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> ValueError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"查询时间范围不能超过 90 天\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第四层：执行安全层\" dir=\"auto\">第四层：执行安全层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SecureToolExecutor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"安全的工具执行器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> executor<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> audit_logger<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>executor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> executor\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>audit_logger <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> audit_logger\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>approval_rules <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"read_only\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"search_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"get_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 自动执行</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"need_approval\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"delete_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"update_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"send_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 需审批</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"forbidden\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"drop_table\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"exec_shell\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 禁止执行</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 权限检查</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_check_permission<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span> PermissionError<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"用户无权调用工具 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">'\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 审批检查</span>\n        risk_level <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_assess_risk<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> risk_level <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"high\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> user_context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"admin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"needs_approval\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 审计日志</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>audit_logger<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>log<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"event\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_call\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"args\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> user_context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 超时控制</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>wait_for<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>executor<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                timeout<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">30</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"success\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> asyncio<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>TimeoutError<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"timeout\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具执行超时\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_assess_risk</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pattern <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>approval_rules<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"forbidden\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_match<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"forbidden\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pattern <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>approval_rules<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"need_approval\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_match<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"high\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"low\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第五层：观测反馈层\" dir=\"auto\">第五层：观测反馈层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ToolCallMonitor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工具调用监控和反馈\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_records <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">record</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> latency_ms<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记录调用信息\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_records<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"args\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"result_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"latency_ms\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> latency_ms<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_metrics</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"计算监控指标\"\"\"</span>\n        total <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_records<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> total <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        success <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sum</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_records <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> r<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"result_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"success\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        failed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> total <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> success\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"total_calls\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> total<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"success_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> success <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> total<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"failure_rate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> failed <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> total<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"avg_latency_ms\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">sum</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"latency_ms\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_records<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> total<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"most_called\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Counter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>r<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_records<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>most_common<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"failure_reasons\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Counter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                r<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"result_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> r <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_records <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> r<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"result_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"success\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>most_common<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"评估指标\" dir=\"auto\">评估指标</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>工具选择准确率</td>\n<td>选择了正确工具的比例</td>\n<td>&gt; 95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数有效率</td>\n<td>参数完全符合 Schema 的比例</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无工具场景误调用率</td>\n<td>不该调时却调用的比例</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>越权拦截率</td>\n<td>被权限系统拦截的调用比例</td>\n<td>记录并分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 模型选择了正确工具但参数错了怎么办？</strong><br>\nA: 返回结构化错误和缺失字段信息，让模型补充或向用户追问。不要用默认值偷偷执行高风险操作。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 什么时候需要用户确认工具调用？</strong><br>\nA: 涉及写操作、删除、付款、外发、权限变更、隐私数据、不可逆影响或高成本操作时需要确认。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：只在执行层做校验就够了。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：必须从定义层就开始控制，五层防线缺一不可。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：工具调用失败就告诉用户\"系统错误\"。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：应该分类处理：可重试的重试，参数错误让模型修正，权限不足说明限制。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：所有工具走同样的安全策略。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：应该分级处理：只读查询自动执行，写操作需确认，高危操作需审批。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}